## 1. Site use

These terms govern browsing ticketrioingressos.com.br and using an account, catalogue, cart or enquiry channel. You agree to provide accurate information and not to engage in fraud, abuse, unauthorised access or conduct that harms other users. The Purchase terms and Privacy policy supplement these terms.

## 2. Information and availability

The catalogue displays Rio de Janeiro tickets and experiences. Photos may be illustrative; prices, dates, sectors, inclusions, availability and specific conditions depend on the current product description and operational confirmation. Enquiry-only products are not a final offer or booking. Online sales are being prepared: browsing, registering, creating a cart or sending an enquiry does not create a charge or ticket.

We may correct material errors and update information while respecting rights already acquired. We do not issue order confirmations or official tickets without the corresponding operational step. Site content does not replace rules set by organisers, suppliers or authorities for each event or experience.

## 3. Accounts and intellectual property

Protect your account access and tell us if you suspect misuse. We may restrict access in cases of fraud or breach of these terms, subject to applicable law. Ticket Rio's or its licensors' brands, layout, text and other content may not be commercially reproduced without permission. External links, including WhatsApp and Google Maps, are subject to their operators' terms.

## 4. Liability and contact

Nothing here excludes mandatory consumer rights or liability that cannot legally be limited. For questions, corrections or complaints, email atendimento@ticketrio.com.br. Brazilian law applies, without prejudice to mandatory consumer and privacy rules applicable to your case. Changes to these terms will be published here.
